06:21.823 --> 06:23.858
What are you talking about?
I'm a natural leader.

06:23.859 --> 06:26.527
That's why I'm so good
at leading Simon Says.

06:26.528 --> 06:28.613
Simon says, "Leave the band."

06:30.282 --> 06:31.832
Yeah, I don't know.

06:31.833 --> 06:33.702
Well, you know what? You guys are wrong.

06:33.703 --> 06:35.135
And I'm gonna prove it to you.

06:35.136 --> 06:36.837
Again, any volunteers?

06:36.838 --> 06:38.872
I'll be your new principal!

06:38.873 --> 06:41.810
Wonderful. Why don't you come
on up and introduce yourself.

06:41.811 --> 06:45.512
All right. James Woods High
cheerleaders, give me a hand!

06:47.682 --> 06:48.949
Check. Him out.

06:48.950 --> 06:50.351
Check. Check him out.

06:50.352 --> 06:52.019
- My name is Peter.
- Check.

06:52.020 --> 06:53.822
- That ain't no lie.
- Check.

06:53.823 --> 06:57.524
I go pop, pop, fizz, fizz,
oh, how sweet it is.

06:57.525 --> 06:58.811
Check! Check!

07:00.170 --> 07:01.720
I'm done with this gum now.

07:01.721 --> 07:02.890
I don't want it.

07:02.891 --> 07:04.127
But I'm done with it.

07:10.847 --> 07:13.399
Mom, why was this
Listerine in the garbage?

07:13.400 --> 07:15.568
Oh, your father says he
doesn't need it anymore

07:15.569 --> 07:17.337
now that he's a high school principal.

07:17.338 --> 07:19.571
Oh, my God, he's not
really doing that, is he?

07:19.572 --> 07:22.075
I'm only gonna get bullied worse now.

07:22.076 --> 07:23.676
Hello, Breakfast Club.

07:23.677 --> 07:26.713
As a principal, I like
to start each morning

07:26.714 --> 07:28.647
