uncoordinated high fives.

07:35.055 --> 07:36.339
Chris, if I may?

07:38.008 --> 07:41.727
Yay! Two fingers and
side-of-the-palm contact.

07:41.728 --> 07:42.895
Perfect!

07:42.896 --> 07:45.164
All right, I got to get to work by 7:40,

07:45.165 --> 07:47.232
'cause that's when high school
starts for some reason.

07:47.233 --> 07:50.869
See you at the
way-too-early 10:40 lunch.

07:52.540 --> 07:54.107
I feel you, Meg.

07:54.108 --> 07:56.559
- Shut up.
- You shut up!

08:02.249 --> 08:05.217
Wow, look at us. Running a B and B.

08:05.218 --> 08:07.854
Yes, so far, all the
guests seem very happy.

08:07.855 --> 08:09.289
Hi, we're checking out.

08:09.290 --> 08:11.023
Just charge my card.

08:11.024 --> 08:12.791
That's weird, that's the fifth couple

08:12.792 --> 08:14.693
