08:14.694 --> 08:16.563
Hi, we'd like a room, please.

08:16.564 --> 08:18.464
Wait, I'm sorry, weren't
you just here a moment ago

08:18.465 --> 08:21.100
with a different man... oh, crap.

08:21.101 --> 08:23.269
Stewie, we have a problem.
The only people checking in

08:23.270 --> 08:24.971
