08:24.972 --> 08:26.371
What? Nonsense.

08:26.372 --> 08:28.308
Well, then why are they all
signing the guest book

08:28.309 --> 08:29.741
and writing quaint things like,

08:29.742 --> 08:32.277
"Railed Crystal good." Oh...

08:32.278 --> 08:33.745
Damn it, this is awful.

08:33.746 --> 08:35.548
How could I have not noticed sooner?

08:35.549 --> 08:36.582
I mean, it's more obvious

08:36.583 --> 08:39.218
than when George Takei
was in the closet.

08:39.219 --> 08:40.786
Hey, George, how are you?

08:40.787 --> 08:43.122
I am a heterosexual.

08:43.123 --> 08:45.058
I love vaginas.

08:46.893 --> 08:48.327
So, what are you doing tonight?

08:48.328 --> 08:51.130
Hopefully, choking on
some lovely lady parts.

08:51.131 --> 08:52.765
Oh, nummers.

08:52.766 --> 08:54.634
All right, that sounds
fun. See you later.

08:54.635 --> 08:57.588
I am a heterosexual.

09:01.691 --> 09:02.842
Good morning, children.

09:02.843 --> 09:05.645
I am your interim
principal, Mr. Griffin.

09:05.646 --> 09:07.646
And to show I'm a fun principal,

09:07.647 --> 09:09.481
I'm gonna do the Ice Bucket Challenge.

09:09.482 --> 09:10.683
Three years too late,

09:10.684 --> 09:12.452
but right on time for a principal.

09:12.453 --> 09:15.473
And making no less sense than
it did when it was current.

09:19.126 --> 09:21.995
You're welcome, person who's
probably already dead.

09:21.996 --> 09:24.429
But, hey, now I got
something even more fun.

09:24.430 --> 09:27.166
How about we all do an
expertly choreographed lip-dub

09:27.167 --> 09:28.800
to a popular song.

09:35.342 --> 09:37.342
<i>♪ Ah... ♪</i>

09:37.343 --> 09:39.145
<i>♪ This hit, that ice cold ♪</i>

09:39.146 --> 09:41.481
<i>♪ Michelle Pfeiffer, that white gold ♪</i>

09:41.482 --> 09:43.315
<i>♪ This one for them hood girls ♪</i>

09:43.316 --> 09:45.484
<i>♪ Them good girls,
straight masterpieces ♪</i>

09:45.485 --> 09:49.521
<i>♪ Stylin', wilin', livin'
it up in the city... ♪</i>

09:51.624 --> 09:53.692
<i>♪ Got to kiss myself, I'm so pretty ♪</i>

09:53.693 --> 09:54.626
<i>♪ I'm too hot ♪</i>

09:54.627 --> 09:55.995
<i>♪ Hot damn ♪</i>

09:55.996 --> 09:57.982
<i>♪ Call the police and the fireman... ♪</i>

10:01.884 --> 10:03.902
Ladies, this is my associate.

10:03.903 --> 10:06.071
Brian, bitches. Bitches, Brian.

