10:16.182 --> 10:18.384
What? Stewie, we're not
gonna become pimps.

10:18.385 --> 10:19.651
Are you sure?

10:19.652 --> 10:21.386
I'm sure. The answer is no,

10:21.387 --> 10:22.921
so don't bother flashing a wad of money,

10:22.922 --> 10:24.723
because there's no way I'm
gonna change my answer

10:24.724 --> 10:26.092
in the middle of this sentence...

10:26.093 --> 10:28.060
Okay, maybe we could try it
out and see how it goes.

10:28.061 --> 10:29.595
Hey, what are you girls
doing standing around?!

10:29.596 --> 10:30.563
Get to work!

10:30.564 --> 10:33.098
Ha-ha! I'm telling you,

10:33.099 --> 10:35.901
that dog is very easily persuaded.

10:35.902 --> 10:38.938
Now let's see what's going
on at the old high school.

10:38.939 --> 10:40.740
Ooh...

10:40.741 --> 10:42.942
Doo-ooh...

10:42.943 --> 10:44.028
Doo...

10:48.297 --> 10:49.915
Hey, guys, guys.

10:49.916 --> 10:51.617
When Borat was making announcements

10:51.618 --> 10:54.520
over the P.A. this morning, that was me.

10:54.521 --> 10:56.722
What?! Shut the front door.

10:56.723 --> 10:59.592
Taco Tuesday is nice.

10:59.593 --> 11:01.727
Knock it off! Give me back my lunch.

11:01.728 --> 11:03.129
What do we got here?

11:03.130 --> 11:05.464
Grape juice in a Ziploc bag?

11:05.465 --> 11:07.383
I have to make my own Capri Suns.

11:09.653 --> 11:11.103
Hey, stupid, what the
hell are you doing?

11:11.104 --> 11:12.204
That's my daughter!

11:12.205 --> 11:14.606
Yeah? What are you gonna do about it?

11:14.607 --> 11:15.974
What am I gonna do about it?

11:15.975 --> 11:17.376
I'll knock your teeth down your throat

11:17.377 --> 11:19.077
and out your butt, you little bastard!

11:19.078 --> 11:20.579
Oh, you think that's funny,

11:20.580 --> 11:22.414
him spilling juice all over the floor?

11:22.415 --> 11:23.949
This is gonna make
people's sneakers sticky,

11:23.950 --> 11:25.450
and then we're gonna
have to listen to...

11:26.619 --> 11:27.786
all day!

11:27.787 --> 11:28.887
Well, I won't have it.

11:28.888 --> 11:30.222
Get on your knees and lick that up!

11:30.223 --> 11:32.558
What? A-Are you serious?

11:32.559 --> 11:34.345
Yeah, I'm serious. I'm the principal!

11:41.451 --> 11:43.602
Oh, my God, I'm so embarrassed.

11:43.603 --> 11:45.004
What are you talking about?

11:45.005 --> 11:47.339
That jerk is finally
getting what he deserves.

11:47.340 --> 11:49.308
Yeah, Meg, now that your
dad's the principal,

11:49.309 --> 11:51.644
